#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:3
#: 4e02ddc379f847428c3d17daf14080fd
msgid "磁序（Magnetic Order）"
msgstr "Magnetic Order"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:5
#: f2590774905a4686b0298eb224fa5d15
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:7
#: 99858c187dae48a78708a3011fb71777
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:9
#: 9e5d3845c2814aa09d0860fc3d13a66d
msgid ""
"根据元素磁矩幅值，从每个输入结构生成 FM、AFM 和随机 PM 初始自旋构型。卡片不改"
"变原子坐标、元素或晶胞；输出统一写入三分量 `spin:R:3`，并同步维护 ASE "
"`initial_magmoms`。"
msgstr "Use element magnetic-moment magnitudes to generate FM, AFM, and random PM initial spin configurations for each input. The card does not change coordinates, elements, or the cell; outputs consistently write three-component `spin:R:3` values and update ASE `initial_magmoms`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:11
#: f02ba18ab5974b00858a4bde8e9065c3
msgid ""
"这张卡生成的是用于 DFT/NEP 数据准备的**初始自旋端点**，不是磁基态判断器，也不"
"能证明某个输出是真正的热力学 FM、AFM 或 PM 相。后续仍需通过电子结构计算、能量"
"比较和收敛后磁矩验证。"
msgstr "This card generates **initial spin endpoints** for DFT/NEP data preparation. It is not a magnetic-ground-state classifier and cannot prove that an output is a thermodynamic FM, AFM, or PM phase. Verify it later with electronic-structure calculations, energy comparisons, and converged magnetic moments."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:13
#: 6e4ffeca6df54cf29a23a4cae8e0dd48
msgid "`Magnetic Order` 与 `Spin Disorder` 的职责不同："
msgstr "`Magnetic Order` and `Spin Disorder` serve different roles:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:15
#: 2bf57e30e9944b4e8fa2b2a921ab1ab4
msgid "`Magnetic Order`：建立 FM、AFM 或完全随机 PM 端点。"
msgstr "`Magnetic Order`: create FM, AFM, or fully random PM endpoints."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:16
#: ca0a8048bcf644acbef76c4e3d61c15f
msgid ""
"`Spin Disorder`：从已有磁态出发，扫描局部翻转比例、随机化比例或锥角无序等中间"
"状态。"
msgstr "`Spin Disorder`: start from an existing magnetic state and scan intermediate states such as local flip fractions, randomization fractions, or cone-angle disorder."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:18
#: 761b31b56dda4b8fb2c7ec5e1366bc09
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and formulas"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:20
#: 57abab947fc04254b63a50a54cf52057
msgid ""
"程序先为每个原子得到磁矩模长 $m_i$。共线输出写入标量 $m_i s_i$，非共线输出沿"
"参考轴 $\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ 写入 $\\mathbf m_i=m_i s_i\\hat{\\mathbf a}$。三类"
"磁序的符号/方向规则为："
msgstr "The program first obtains a moment magnitude $m_i$ for each atom. Collinear outputs use the scalar $m_i s_i$; non-collinear outputs use $\\mathbf m_i=m_i s_i\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ along the reference axis $\\hat{\\mathbf a}$. The sign and direction rules for the three orders are:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:24
#: 6801f8bcf3cd4b83a952bb284a117885
msgid "铁磁（FM）：所有磁性原子 $s_i=+1$；"
msgstr "Ferromagnetic (FM): every magnetic atom has $s_i=+1$;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:25
#: 8eb02d913ca64b8c9765efb575ea7bfc
msgid "反铁磁（AFM）：按 k 向量层号或 A/B 分组交替给出 $s_i=\\pm1$；"
msgstr "Antiferromagnetic (AFM): alternate $s_i=\\pm1$ by k-vector layer index or A/B groups;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:26
#: 1300482fd94e4fd883759156451a66a9
msgid ""
"顺磁近似（PM）：共线模式随机取正负号，非共线模式按球面、圆锥、平面或轴向规则"
"抽方向。"
msgstr "Paramagnetic approximation (PM): choose random signs in collinear mode, or sample directions on a sphere, cone, plane, or axis in non-collinear mode."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:28
#: 640dcf0831a04bda89de7ab1539d443b
msgid ""
"`平衡正负磁矩`只约束有限样本中的正负数量尽量相等，不等价于热力学顺磁系综；这"
"张卡生成 的是用于训练覆盖的磁构型快照，不是在求磁性基态。"
msgstr "`Balance positive and negative moments` only makes the sign counts as equal as possible in a finite sample; it is not a thermodynamic paramagnetic ensemble. This card generates magnetic snapshots for training coverage, not a magnetic ground state."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:31
#: db4e705743f7412c99351ad21760f4d3
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:33
#: 2d9849c20ba345829c25b68659943b9a
msgid "场景：BCC Fe 模型只见过 FM，AFM 测试误差明显更高"
msgstr "Scenario: a BCC Fe model has seen only FM states and has much higher AFM test error"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:35
#: fdaea18486dc421fb20b8254c9346ba0
msgid ""
"训练集中的 BCC Fe 全是 FM 初态，模型在分层 AFM 构型上的能量和磁力误差显著增"
"大。需要对同一批几何结构补充 FM、AFM 和随机 PM 自旋端点，分离“几何覆盖不足”和"
"“磁环境覆盖不足”。"
msgstr "All BCC Fe structures in the training set are FM initial states, and energy and magnetic-force errors increase sharply for layered AFM configurations. Add FM, AFM, and random PM spin endpoints for the same geometries to separate insufficient geometric coverage from insufficient magnetic-environment coverage."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:37
#: 4cbd35b5abfb4099a513e33c49887d48
msgid "**输入：** 2×2×2 BCC Fe 周期超胞。"
msgstr "**Input:** a 2×2×2 periodic BCC Fe supercell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:39
#: 8e0296279763490690fd185876972ea8
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:41
#: 868e48a5d9974dfda1539378e14bc126
msgid "`自旋模型`（`format`） = `collinear`"
msgstr "`Spin model` (`format`) = `collinear`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:42
#: 444c8f8a7a334fbbbf46d93d4b9ab2ca
msgid "`参考轴`（`axis`） = `[0, 0, 1]`"
msgstr "`Reference axis` (`axis`) = `[0, 0, 1]`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:43
#: 2e419264e7d74b64b4657fcac6753ae1
msgid "`Element moments` = `Fe:2.2`"
msgstr "`Element moments` = `Fe:2.2`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:44
#: 96e39f87ab22475f984fbdf6d5adef7f
msgid "开启 FM、AFM 和 PM"
msgstr "Enable FM, AFM, and PM"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:45
#: f8b626353a8a44bbb09a7788f30d614d
msgid "`AFM 分配方式`（`afm_mode`） = `k_vector`"
msgstr "`AFM assignment mode` (`afm_mode`) = `k_vector`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:46
#: 586c36fc10d4407a9934cca5b1cbec7d
msgid "`AFM 层向量`（`afm_kvec`） = `111`"
msgstr "`AFM layer vector` (`afm_kvec`) = `111`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:47
#: d6b5b7d9a3a645109679f2e8ad98f6af
msgid "`PM structures per input` = `8`"
msgstr "`PM structures per input` = `8`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:48
#: c83ade506e0149acba319e8d4f3107e4
msgid "开启`使用随机种子`并把`随机种子`设为 `42`"
msgstr "Enable `Use seed` and set `Seed` to `42`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:50
#: dc6282110b794b718971910c9ab3d91c
msgid ""
"**运行前检查：** 首输入预览应显示 16 个磁性原子、AFM `+8/-8`，并给出每个输入"
"及整个数据集的预计输出数量。如果 AFM 只有一个符号，先扩胞或更换 layer "
"vector。"
msgstr "**Before running:** the first-input preview should show 16 magnetic atoms, AFM `+8/-8`, and estimated output counts per input and for the dataset. If AFM has only one sign, expand the cell or change the layer vector."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:52
#: f2a4e9f456ad4f3eb7e0ac2f7b211a46
msgid ""
"**输出：** 每个输入生成 1 个 FM、1 个 AFM 和 8 个随机 PM，共 10 个结构。"
msgstr "**Output:** each input produces one FM, one AFM, and eight random PM structures, for ten structures total."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:54
#: bbe5783333c14933b7f60a0d2481aea0
msgid "**验证改善：**"
msgstr "**Validate the improvement:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:56
#: 82db4ff483294fc399a242a64b502225
msgid "检查 FM 自旋沿参考轴同向，AFM 同时包含正负号。"
msgstr "Check that FM spins align along the reference axis and AFM contains both signs."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:57
#: eda0ae5346e442cba0701b7e38fbe365
msgid "固定 seed 后重复运行，PM 自旋应逐帧一致。"
msgstr "Repeat the run with a fixed seed; PM spins should match frame by frame."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:58
#: bdd05406246146fb996365ee83e1daa8
msgid "重训后分别比较 FM、AFM 和随机 PM 测试切片，不能只看混合总 RMSE。"
msgstr "After retraining, compare FM, AFM, and random-PM test slices separately; do not rely only on the mixed overall RMSE."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:60
#: 146aae0614304a2bb769ba095afcd435
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:62
#: 5570a50aa6d4425aa8cce32fd9d48e7f
msgid "自旋模型和磁矩幅值"
msgstr "Spin model and moment magnitudes"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:64
#: f4c7894b43b8415d8a5dbf3309beed6b
msgid "自旋模型（format）"
msgstr "format"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:66
#: a1ac293a25104e2db05b1688d1d86d68
msgid "`str`，默认 `collinear`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `collinear`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:68
#: 4ff1aa1a798846dcbb204e0287db1bc2
msgid "`collinear`：所有输出沿参考轴，只改变正负符号。"
msgstr "`collinear`: all outputs lie along the reference axis; only the sign changes."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:69
#: b82d8806d35c46c2bedbca9f05a613f6
msgid ""
"`noncollinear`：FM/AFM 可使用三维参考方向，PM 可在球面、锥面、平面或参考轴上"
"取向。"
msgstr "`noncollinear`: FM/AFM may use a three-dimensional reference direction; PM may orient on a sphere, cone, plane, or reference axis."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:71
#: 778f6a2aaaba42e3bf83f7f49cb832b7
msgid ""
"旧项目中的 `Collinear (scalar)` 和 `Non-collinear (vector)` 会继续读取。这里"
"的“模型”描述允许的自旋方向，不是文件格式；导出的规范字段始终是 `spin:R:3`。"
msgstr "Legacy `Collinear (scalar)` and `Non-collinear (vector)` values remain readable. Here `model` describes allowed spin directions, not the file format; the canonical exported field is always `spin:R:3`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:73
#: a94617210bc44292a2a7cb86d294d978
msgid "参考轴（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:75
#: 0ccae3c505d04aa4a80d25960df045e0
msgid ""
"`[x, y, z]`，默认 `[0, 0, 1]`。必须是有限的非零三分量向量。程序内部会归一化："
msgstr "`[x, y, z]`, default `[0, 0, 1]`. It must be a finite, nonzero three-component vector. The program normalizes it internally:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:77
#: cfa2a7a6066c46f6917974896a1ae007
msgid "共线 FM/AFM/PM 使用 $\\pm\\hat{\\mathbf a}$。"
msgstr "Collinear FM/AFM/PM use $\\pm\\hat{\\mathbf a}$."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:78
#: 13655faeaec54ffbb598633f981c2e2b
msgid "非共线 FM/AFM 默认以它为方向。"
msgstr "Non-collinear FM/AFM use it as the default direction."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:79
#: bb66ce477ac64ae2824a3fc74871108d
msgid "非共线 PM 的 cone、plane 和 axis 分布以它为参考。"
msgstr "The cone, plane, and axis distributions for non-collinear PM use it as the reference."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:81
#: bf103c89f98d44bdb8eafa30d90d2d6d
msgid "元素磁矩（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:83
#: 5bcf696ae0cd4ddaa190e5150bda487b
msgid "`str`，默认空。用于指定逐元素磁矩，单位为 $\\mu_\\mathrm{B}$："
msgstr "`str`, default empty. Specify per-element magnetic moments in $\\mu_\\mathrm{B}$:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:85
#: 8dce8e6287144886915ddb3c84c7b5e3
msgid "Fe:2.2,Co:1.7,Ni:0.6\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:89
#: 7adf01234d1f427ab13f87a3a32950fa
msgid "非共线模式也接受向量值；向量的模长同时决定磁矩大小："
msgstr "Non-collinear mode also accepts vector values; the vector norm determines the moment magnitude:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:91
#: 3cc434fcee1e4175b2f01535f3f2a15e
msgid "Fe:[0,0,2.2],Cr:[0,0,-1.5]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:95
#: 01c8262dea4f40d0afa9f20a822038ea
msgid "也可使用 JSON："
msgstr "JSON is also accepted:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:97
#: e6f6c475fe04426caffeb47ca988b63c
msgid "{\"Fe\": [0, 0, 2.2], \"Cr\": [0, 0, -1.5]}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:101
#: 57653418362c4b2bb9cbe7416d22658e
msgid "使用元素向量方向（use_element_dirs）"
msgstr "use_element_dirs"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:103
#: ab4d6c2dc633430cae8bbf1e0b15a49c
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false，仅非共线 FM/AFM 使用。开启后，向量形式的元素条目会成为该"
"元素的参考方向，AFM 再在这些方向上施加正负号。"
msgstr "`bool`, default false; used only by non-collinear FM/AFM. When enabled, vector-valued element entries become the reference direction for each element, and AFM applies positive or negative signs along those directions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:105
#: 75db11f9caf540e8902bbd390e01b66d
msgid ""
"开启此项后，`MagFMnc` 表示所有原子使用 FM 正号分支，并不保证不同元素的向量彼"
"此平行。普通 FM/AFM 数据准备建议保持关闭；需要自定义多元素方向时应仔细检查输"
"出。"
msgstr "When enabled, `MagFMnc` means that all atoms use the positive FM branch; it does not guarantee parallel vectors across different elements. Keep it disabled for ordinary FM/AFM data preparation and inspect outputs carefully when customizing multielement directions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:107
#: 5e14979aa4b9441b9079d6a06cdf698d
msgid "未列元素磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:109
#: 5a2fe845e8784ee2aa9f77291194f869
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.0`。对作用范围内、但未出现在 `元素磁矩`（`magmom_map`）中的"
"元素使用该非负磁矩幅值。"
msgstr "`float`, default `0.0`. Use this nonnegative moment magnitude for in-scope elements absent from `Element moments` (`magmom_map`)."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:111
#: dcd01c9275e142eb9c913c184fe02ecb
msgid "仅作用于元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "apply_elements"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:113
#: f560a613990443db8177229fbb3e760d
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。逗号分隔，例如 `Fe,Co`。非空时，只有列出的元素参与磁矩映射；其"
"他元素磁矩为 0。留空时考虑全部元素。"
msgstr "`str`, default empty. Enter comma-separated elements such as `Fe,Co`. When nonempty, only listed elements participate in moment mapping and all others have zero moments. When empty, all elements are considered."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:115
#: 4e4d6f05638441d092eb87bcfc57cdcf
msgid ""
"执行顺序是：先按 `仅作用于元素`（`apply_elements`）选择元素，再从 `元素磁矩`"
"（`magmom_map`）读取幅值，未命中时使用 `未列元素磁矩`（`default_moment`）。如"
"果最终没有任何非零磁矩，卡片明确失败，不生成带错误磁序标签的全零结构。"
msgstr "The order is: select elements with `Apply only to elements` (`apply_elements`), read magnitudes from `Element moments` (`magmom_map`), and use `Unlisted-element moment` (`default_moment`) for misses. If no nonzero moments remain, the card fails explicitly instead of generating an all-zero structure with a misleading magnetic-order label."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:117
#: dba9cf63d2384e7590b8aaa569274ae3
msgid "输出分支"
msgstr "Output branches"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:119
#: f88a5e43db4145579907321099be7ed9
msgid "生成 FM（gen_fm）"
msgstr "gen_fm"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:121
#: 4c981d42c6cf45d7a0f487fb58010d00
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。生成一个正号 FM 分支。"
msgstr "`bool`, default true. Generate one positive-sign FM branch."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:123
#: f392861cf2204737b30877d763febe2e
msgid "生成 AFM（gen_afm）"
msgstr "gen_afm"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:125
#: 82c43ecf1a09463cbb917163ed93f1e9
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。开启后生成一个 AFM 分支，并显示 AFM 分配参数。"
msgstr "`bool`, default false. When enabled, generate one AFM branch and show AFM assignment parameters."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:127
#: e989ef199d984283ba8a53e98cd91fd0
msgid "生成随机 PM（gen_pm）"
msgstr "gen_pm"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:129
#: 3bdbf6a1d46f49a6a74d60d1735a5d9b
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。开启后生成 `每个输入的 PM 数量`（`pm_count`）个随机 PM 初"
"始态。"
msgstr "`bool`, default false. When enabled, generate `PM structures per input` (`pm_count`) random PM initial states."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:131
#: 24aef07e448e4445a6659c059f153d59
msgid "FM、AFM 和 PM 至少要开启一个；全部关闭会明确失败。"
msgstr "At least one of FM, AFM, and PM must be enabled; disabling all three fails explicitly."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:133
#: 86f4dce67d0d4282a4fcb8adaa2b95eb
msgid "AFM 分配"
msgstr "AFM assignment"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:135
#: 268cfd3946524900aa7bd61b17f134c9
msgid "AFM 分配方式（afm_mode）"
msgstr "afm_mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:137
#: bc3b5690cc6f45e78e5ca373b064d2f9
msgid "`str`，默认 `k_vector`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `k_vector`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:139
#: 2889a8fdbb8c4499a5f5aa2d21e15bf7
msgid "`k_vector`：按当前晶胞的分数坐标层交替分配正负号。"
msgstr "`k_vector`: alternate signs by fractional-coordinate layers of the current cell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:140
#: b7f723c2bac9499a84deef29d008d889
msgid ""
"`group_ab`：读取已有的 `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`，由两个标签指定正负号。"
msgstr "`group_ab`: read the existing `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` and assign signs from two labels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:142
#: 7ec7da71d336401094e8727e38df40e2
msgid ""
"旧值 `k-vector` 和 `group A/B` 会继续读取。group 模式缺少输入标签时不会再静默"
"退回 k-vector。"
msgstr "Legacy values `k-vector` and `group A/B` remain readable. If group mode lacks input labels, it no longer silently falls back to k-vector."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:144
#: 4ad82da1057d41ebbb76e3f428470964
msgid "AFM 层向量（afm_kvec）"
msgstr "afm_kvec"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:146
#: 43c5e61cc6d9450b8cd013a1c9551a1d
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `111`，仅 `k_vector` 使用。可选 `100`、`010`、`001`、`110` 和 "
"`111`，分别对应当前晶胞分数坐标中的 a、b、c、a+b 和 a+b+c 相位方向。"
msgstr "`str`, default `111`, used only by `k_vector`. Choose `100`, `010`, `001`, `110`, or `111`, corresponding to phase directions a, b, c, a+b, and a+b+c in the current cell's fractional coordinates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:148
#: c22daf6a8eb444058ab0606f4dfcd589
msgid ""
"该规则依赖当前晶胞和坐标原点。若磁性原子只产生一种符号，卡片会要求扩胞或更换"
"向量，而不是把 FM-like 结果标成 AFM。"
msgstr "This rule depends on the current cell and coordinate origin. If magnetic atoms produce only one sign, the card requires a larger cell or a different vector rather than labeling the FM-like result as AFM."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:150
#: 6ba9830e546944bda3129a753cda73c5
msgid "AFM 正号组（afm_group_a）"
msgstr "afm_group_a"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:152
#: 66116fd5756a46668cb6450fb14f701b
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `A`，仅 `group_ab` 使用。必须非空，并在磁性原子中至少匹配一个输"
"入 `group`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `A`, used only by `group_ab`. It must be nonempty and match at least one input `group` among magnetic atoms."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:154
#: fbbcc5be765244009ecccc38a8abab35
msgid "AFM 负号组（afm_group_b）"
msgstr "afm_group_b"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:156
#: f820cf4932bf405bbcdb74484a323ba1
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `B`，仅 `group_ab` 使用。必须非空、与正号组不同，并在磁性原子中至"
"少匹配一个输入 `group`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `B`, used only by `group_ab`. It must be nonempty, differ from the positive-sign group, and match at least one input `group` among magnetic atoms."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:158
#: bc43beb9067945c88a8c1aed3a51a518
msgid "其他分组置零（afm_zero_unknown）"
msgstr "afm_zero_unknown"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:160
#: d803a828007f4ea3be66029b842fa217
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 true。开启时，不属于正号组或负号组的原子磁矩置零；关闭时，这些原"
"子使用正号。该设置不会把 `group` 当成晶体学 `sublattice`。"
msgstr "`bool`, default true. When enabled, atoms outside the positive- or negative-sign groups receive zero moments; when disabled, they use the positive sign. This setting does not interpret `group` as a crystallographic `sublattice`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:162
#: 03a346ed9fa447e69fb92ee94562922d
msgid "随机 PM"
msgstr "Random PM"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:164
#: d541e3ac88a9479787ef591a21082416
msgid "每个输入的 PM 数量（pm_count）"
msgstr "pm_count"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:166
#: b1395d1d2149425089619ed8697efa26
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `10`，最小为 1。总输出数为已开启的 FM/AFM 分支数加 `每个输入的 "
"PM 数量`（`pm_count`）。"
msgstr "`int`, default `10`, minimum 1. Total outputs equal the enabled FM/AFM branches plus `PM structures per input` (`pm_count`)."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:168
#: cf066d8f56a14909b4d8a1fdb9db8859
msgid "PM 方向分布（pm_direction）"
msgstr "pm_direction"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:170
#: ad6bd622d3e240afb93712130bc0cd3d
msgid "`str`，默认 `sphere`，仅非共线 PM 生效。"
msgstr "`str`, default `sphere`, used only for non-collinear PM."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:172
#: 334023f79708431daf56620ed2eb3570
msgid "`sphere`：整个球面均匀随机。"
msgstr "`sphere`: uniform random directions over the full sphere."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:173
#: 3792a325f4a24e379fc6e9216e168563
msgid "`cone`：参考轴周围的锥内随机。"
msgstr "`cone`: random directions within a cone around the reference axis."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:174
#: f31d5ebf140b40ee89e854035c8083fc
msgid "`plane`：垂直于参考轴的平面内随机。"
msgstr "`plane`: random directions in the plane perpendicular to the reference axis."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:175
#: 59e3fc6b91764a8c9004ba14f30bd2eb
msgid "`参考轴`（`axis`）：沿参考轴随机取正负方向。"
msgstr "`Reference axis` (`axis`): randomly choose the positive or negative reference-axis direction."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:177
#: c78344f5d0e245beb15625956e6a3f47
msgid "共线 PM 始终沿参考轴随机取正负号，不使用该参数。"
msgstr "Collinear PM always chooses a random sign along the reference axis and does not use this parameter."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:179
#: 98d0b88b0a9641428f9ba2229dba9b0f
msgid "PM 锥半角（pm_cone_angle）"
msgstr "pm_cone_angle"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:181
#: 034e2d7c616f4bdfa628436edcbe2edc
msgid "`float`，默认 `30.0`，范围 0–180°，仅非共线 `cone` 使用。"
msgstr "`float`, default `30.0`, range 0–180°, used only by non-collinear `cone`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:183
#: 86cbf661cc3840cdaabfc72c613c9ef8
msgid "按模长配对反向 PM（pm_balanced）"
msgstr "pm_balanced"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:185
#: 282939a3cebc4e91b6f7d058eda96aaa
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 true。程序按相同磁矩模长分别生成反向方向对；完整配对会精确抵消，"
"某一模长对应奇数个原子时可能留下一个残余磁矩。"
msgstr "`bool`, default true. The program generates opposite-direction pairs for equal moment magnitudes; complete pairs cancel exactly, while an odd number of atoms at one magnitude may leave a residual moment."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:187
#: ca62ebc53bea4245ab1a0417b55c714b
msgid ""
"在 `cone` 模式下，开启配对意味着方向分布在 $+\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ 和 $-"
"\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ 两个锥内，而不是通过减均值破坏锥角限制。"
msgstr "In `cone` mode, pairing distributes directions within cones around both $+\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ and $-\\hat{\\mathbf a}$ rather than subtracting the mean and violating the cone-angle limit."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:189
#: 4f0ae36e39154cc89be2c4b073bf017b
msgid "随机性和输出预算"
msgstr "Randomness and output budget"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:191
#: ea15c15339f44197af72885c3d6449af
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "use_seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:193
#: 991a3fe4f29b4dd996910d490723753c
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false，仅 PM 分支使用。开启后，seed、输入结构稳定标识和 PM 序号"
"共同决定随机状态。"
msgstr "`bool`, default false, used only for PM branches. When enabled, the seed, stable input-structure identifier, and PM index jointly determine the random state."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:195
#: 090d7f3623c24a6bb5c02e2e7a1d1173
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:197
#: 7726dd516e1b4a52b64a094ff4491fc4
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`，必须非负。"
msgstr "`int`, default `0`, must be non-negative."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:199
#: 049e70832d104b779058b89e2c85b637
msgid "每个输入最大输出（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:201
#: 533c1f179a804f23af8e60b4f900c305
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `100`，最小为 1。如果 FM、AFM 和 PM 的预计输出总数超过该值，卡片"
"明确失败，防止误设 `每个输入的 PM 数量`（`pm_count`）后生成过量结构。"
msgstr "`int`, default `100`, minimum 1. If the estimated total FM, AFM, and PM outputs exceed this value, the card fails explicitly to prevent an accidental excessive output count from `PM structures per input` (`pm_count`)."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:203
#: 449c916b09f84f82b2215e7a2f0edf26
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:205
#: 3ff583874c47405fa974d124c57655a3
msgid "FM 单端点"
msgstr "FM single endpoint"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:207
#: 968c8d0b3a354010be00ddd74179b5b0
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticOrderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"format\": \"collinear\",\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2\",\n"
"    \"use_element_dirs\": false,\n"
"    \"default_moment\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"apply_elements\": \"Fe\",\n"
"    \"gen_fm\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_afm\": false,\n"
"    \"afm_mode\": \"k_vector\",\n"
"    \"afm_kvec\": \"111\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_a\": \"A\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_b\": \"B\",\n"
"    \"afm_zero_unknown\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_pm\": false,\n"
"    \"pm_count\": 10,\n"
"    \"pm_direction\": \"sphere\",\n"
"    \"pm_cone_angle\": 30.0,\n"
"    \"pm_balanced\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": false,\n"
"    \"seed\": 0,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 100\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:237
#: 1d86d8d663c742ff8e9c0cccd06b14bb
msgid "FM + 分层 AFM + 共线 PM"
msgstr "FM + layered AFM + collinear PM"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:239
#: fb7f78ae1e1f4ed4b2c4b7074a074338
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticOrderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"format\": \"collinear\",\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2\",\n"
"    \"use_element_dirs\": false,\n"
"    \"default_moment\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"apply_elements\": \"Fe\",\n"
"    \"gen_fm\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_afm\": true,\n"
"    \"afm_mode\": \"k_vector\",\n"
"    \"afm_kvec\": \"111\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_a\": \"A\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_b\": \"B\",\n"
"    \"afm_zero_unknown\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_pm\": true,\n"
"    \"pm_count\": 8,\n"
"    \"pm_direction\": \"sphere\",\n"
"    \"pm_cone_angle\": 30.0,\n"
"    \"pm_balanced\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 20\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:269
#: 883be644754c49d2a2ab6370cc98a5e2
msgid "非共线球面 PM"
msgstr "Non-collinear spherical PM"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:271
#: fc53a6df45934a0083d91203104b72da
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticOrderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"format\": \"noncollinear\",\n"
"    \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2,Co:1.7\",\n"
"    \"use_element_dirs\": false,\n"
"    \"default_moment\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"apply_elements\": \"Fe,Co\",\n"
"    \"gen_fm\": false,\n"
"    \"gen_afm\": false,\n"
"    \"afm_mode\": \"k_vector\",\n"
"    \"afm_kvec\": \"111\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_a\": \"A\",\n"
"    \"afm_group_b\": \"B\",\n"
"    \"afm_zero_unknown\": true,\n"
"    \"gen_pm\": true,\n"
"    \"pm_count\": 16,\n"
"    \"pm_direction\": \"sphere\",\n"
"    \"pm_cone_angle\": 30.0,\n"
"    \"pm_balanced\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 7,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 20\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:301
#: 3a3b81814b7c493d9c685eefdd3faa09
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:303
#: 923cbdf22dd34e66ba9e9363dc2546d4
msgid ""
"`Group Label` → `Magnetic Order`：已有 coordinate-based group 时，用 "
"`group_ab` 生成对应 AFM 正负号。"
msgstr "`Group Label` → `Magnetic Order`: when coordinate-based groups already exist, use `group_ab` to generate the corresponding AFM signs."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:304
#: e041eef917f0489d9c11c1b4b2ff7bdb
msgid ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `Spin Disorder`：先建立 FM/AFM 端点，再扫描局部无序比例。"
msgstr "`Magnetic Order` → `Spin Disorder`: first establish FM/AFM endpoints, then scan the local disorder fraction."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:305
#: 5546e09f44474dbc851d4f47b0ed7fba
msgid ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `Small-Angle Spin Tilt`：在端点附近补充确定性小角偏转。"
msgstr "`Magnetic Order` → `Small-Angle Spin Tilt`: add deterministic small-angle tilts around the endpoints."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:306
#: 86adcc2abf614eaeab32f6f8cff96869
msgid ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `Spin Spiral`：复用元素磁矩幅值，生成位置连续的螺旋磁序。"
msgstr "`Magnetic Order` → `Spin Spiral`: reuse element moment magnitudes to generate a position-continuous spiral order."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:308
#: 9045887dd88542e2812f508452f85abe
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:310
#: aecce6f0dd5849679836fc6e3dc933f3
msgid ""
"**预览提示没有非零磁矩。** `元素磁矩`（`magmom_map`）为空、磁矩都是 0，或 `仅"
"作用于元素`（`apply_elements`）排除了所有映射元素。卡片不会把全零自旋标成 FM/"
"AFM/PM。"
msgstr "**The preview reports no nonzero moments.** `Element moments` (`magmom_map`) is empty, all moments are zero, or `Apply only to elements` (`apply_elements`) excludes every mapped element. The card does not label an all-zero spin as FM/AFM/PM."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:312
#: 56840639f8f540b087f7da8283ab295d
msgid ""
"**AFM 提示只有一个符号。** 当前晶胞在所选 k-vector 下没有足够的交替相位。先扩"
"胞或更换 layer vector。"
msgstr "**The AFM preview contains only one sign.** The current cell does not provide enough alternating phases for the selected k-vector. Enlarge the cell or choose another layer vector."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:314
#: 40d321836fb245eb918af781c8f5ebd5
msgid ""
"**group 模式提示缺少 A/B。** 输入必须已有 `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`，且正负标"
"签各自至少匹配一个非零磁矩原子。不会自动识别晶体学子晶格，也不会静默回退。"
msgstr "**The group mode reports missing A/B groups.** The input must already contain `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`, and each sign label must match at least one atom with a nonzero moment. The card does not infer crystallographic sublattices or silently fall back."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:316
#: c6ae11a861f145909e1469b8d00b4307
msgid ""
"**配对后的 PM 净磁矩仍不完全为零。** 某种磁矩模长对应奇数个原子时会留下一个未"
"配对方向；不同模长之间不会通过改变模长强行抵消。"
msgstr "**The paired PM net moment is not exactly zero.** An odd number of atoms with a given moment magnitude leaves one unpaired direction; different magnitudes are not forcibly canceled by changing their sizes."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:318
#: 83a78101c8b140a1b2bf2a3671bc7757
msgid ""
"**PM 和 Spin Disorder 是否重复。** PM 分支把全部磁性原子直接放到一个随机端"
"点；`Spin Disorder` 能按比例只扰动部分已有自旋并扫描中间无序度。"
msgstr "**Are PM and Spin Disorder redundant?** A PM branch places all magnetic atoms directly in a random endpoint; `Spin Disorder` can perturb only a fraction of existing spins and scan intermediate disorder levels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:320
#: bd4be231ab844616904f20338d37a103
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:322
#: 520df286a20740d9b4bbd136c4f090b3
msgid "`MagFM` / `MagFMnc`：共线 / 非共线 FM 正号分支。"
msgstr "`MagFM` / `MagFMnc`: collinear / non-collinear positive-sign FM branches."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:323
#: 58dedafe98fa4a7cae98a3ed7894e992
msgid "`MagAFM111` / `MagAFM111nc`：按 k-vector 生成的 AFM。"
msgstr "`MagAFM111` / `MagAFM111nc`: AFM generated from a k-vector."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:324
#: 3cd943277fce4d51970259b56ff12ba3
msgid "`MagAFMg` / `MagAFMgnc`：按现有 group 标签生成的 AFM。"
msgstr "`MagAFMg` / `MagAFMgnc`: AFM generated from existing group labels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:325
#: 2160a95423ea458f8769030024860e80
msgid "`MagPM` / `MagPMnc`：随机 PM；固定 seed 时标签带派生 seed。"
msgstr "`MagPM` / `MagPMnc`: random PM; with a fixed seed, the label includes the derived seed."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:327
#: 1aff6330e22745d7b5a9119beb51c13c
msgid ""
"所有导出输出写入 `spin:R:3`。共线模式内部保留标量 `initial_magmoms`，导出时仍"
"按参考轴转换为三分量 spin。"
msgstr "All exported outputs write `spin:R:3`. Collinear mode keeps scalar `initial_magmoms` internally, then converts it along the reference axis to three-component spin on export."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:329
#: 5b1d7d1ac74d403f88e66cf259e2444c
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:331
#: 81fbf7f4c108409e98677a6146748eaf
msgid ""
"FM 和 AFM 没有随机性。PM 开启 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）后，同一输入、参数"
"和 seed 会得到相同输出。"
msgstr "FM and AFM are deterministic. For PM, enabling `Use random seed` (`use_seed`) makes the same input, parameters, and seed produce the same outputs."

#~ msgid "磁有序初始化（Magnetic Order）"
#~ msgstr "Magnetic-Order Initialization (Magnetic Order)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "从一个磁性母相结构出发，一次性生成 FM（铁磁）、AFM（反铁磁）、PM（顺磁）多"
#~ "种磁序分支。每个输出结构都写入对应的三分量 `spin` 数组和 `Config_type` 标"
#~ "签；内部同时维护 ASE `initial_magmoms` 兼容别名。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Branch one magnetic parent structure into ferromagnetic (FM), "
#~ "antiferromagnetic (AFM), and paramagnetic-like (PM) initial states. Every "
#~ "output receives a three-component `spin` array and a `Config_type` label; "
#~ "the internal ASE `initial_magmoms` compatibility alias is kept in sync."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**关键限制：** 这张卡只写入初始磁矩，不保证生成的就是磁基态。磁矩是否收敛"
#~ "到合理值仍需要用 NEP/DFT 后续计算验证。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Important limitation:** This card assigns initial moments; it does not "
#~ "determine a magnetic ground state. Whether a state converges to a "
#~ "physically meaningful solution must be established by the subsequent NEP "
#~ "or DFT calculation."

#~ msgid "场景：FM 模型在 AFM 相上预测崩了"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: an FM-trained model fails on an AFM state"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 bcc Fe 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，所有训练数据来自 FM 构型。模型对铁磁态"
#~ "的能量和力预测很好，但一跑 AFM 构型，能量误差是 FM 的 5 倍。诊断结果是：训"
#~ "练集里只有一种磁序，模型把\"所有磁矩同向\"当成了默认假设，碰到磁矩翻转的结"
#~ "构只能瞎猜。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "You trained an NEP model for bcc Fe using only FM configurations. It "
#~ "predicts FM energies and forces accurately, but its energy error on AFM "
#~ "configurations is five times larger. The training set contains only one "
#~ "order, so reversed local moments lie outside the magnetic environments "
#~ "the model has learned."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** 磁性体系的训练集至少应该覆盖 FM 和 AFM 两种极端磁序，如果体"
#~ "系可能有顺磁相，PM 也要加。不同磁序下，同一种原子的局域磁环境完全不同——模"
#~ "型需要见过这些环境才能泛化。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** A magnetic training set should cover the ordered states "
#~ "relevant to the material, commonly including FM and one or more AFM "
#~ "patterns. If disordered local moments are relevant, add paramagnetic-like "
#~ "samples as well. The same atom can have very different local magnetic "
#~ "environments under these orders, and the model must see them before it "
#~ "can interpolate between them."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输入：** 一个含 Fe 的 bcc 晶体，已知 Fe 的磁矩约 2.2 μB（来自 DFT 或文"
#~ "献）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** A bcc Fe crystal with an Fe reference moment of approximately "
#~ "2.2 μB from DFT or literature."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**目标：** 从一个结构出发，生成 1 个 FM + 1 个 AFM（k-vector 111）+ 8 个 "
#~ "PM，共 10 个不同磁序的训练样本"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Goal:** From one structure, generate one FM state, one AFM state with k-"
#~ "vector 111, and eight PM-like states, for ten magnetic initializations in "
#~ "total."

#~ msgid "`Format` = `Collinear (scalar)` （先从不共线开始，复杂度低）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Format` = `Collinear (scalar)` (start with the lower-complexity "
#~ "collinear representation)"

#~ msgid "`Gen FM` = 勾选，`Gen AFM` = 勾选"
#~ msgstr "Enable `Gen FM` and `Gen AFM`."

#~ msgid "`Gen PM` = 勾选，`PM Count` = `[8]`"
#~ msgstr "Enable `Gen PM` and set `PM Count` to `[8]`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出：** 1 个 FM + 1 个 AFM + 8 个 PM，全部带 `spin:R:3` 和对应的 "
#~ "`Config_type` 标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** One FM, one AFM, and eight PM-like structures, all with "
#~ "`spin:R:3` and matching `Config_type` labels."

#~ msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
#~ msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#~ msgid "重训后用这组数据里的 FM 和 AFM 分别做推理，能量误差差异应该显著缩小"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "After DFT labeling and retraining, compare held-out FM and AFM errors; "
#~ "the large order-dependent gap should decrease."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "抽查 FM/AFM 的 `spin`：FM 沿 Axis 同向，AFM 在 111 方向上相邻层符号翻转"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Inspect FM/AFM `spin`: FM moments should point in the same direction "
#~ "along the Axis, while adjacent layers along 111 should alternate signs in "
#~ "AFM."

#~ msgid "如果 AFM 效果仍差，换 `AFM Kvec` = `110` 或 `100`，覆盖不同翻转周期"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If AFM behavior remains poor, test physically relevant `AFM Kvec` values "
#~ "such as `110` or `100` to cover different alternation patterns."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果 PM 结构能量分布异常宽，可能是磁矩幅值设置不合理——检查 `magmom_map` "
#~ "或 `default_moment`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If PM-like energies span an implausibly wide range, verify the magnitudes "
#~ "in `magmom_map` and `default_moment` before generating more samples."

#~ msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
#~ msgstr "When to add this card"

#~ msgid "**加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#~ msgid "模型在不同磁序之间泛化差（FM 推理好、AFM 崩）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The model transfers poorly between magnetic orders, for example "
#~ "succeeding on FM but failing on AFM."

#~ msgid "研究体系本身存在多种磁有序相（如 Fe、NiO、钙钛矿磁性材料）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The material supports several relevant magnetic orders, as in Fe, NiO, or "
#~ "magnetic perovskites."

#~ msgid "需要模型能区分磁基态和激发态"
#~ msgstr "The model must distinguish magnetic ground and excited states."

#~ msgid "**不加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#~ msgid "体系是非磁的（纯 Si、Al 等），加了只会引入无意义的磁矩标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The system is nonmagnetic, such as elemental Si or Al; moment labels "
#~ "would be meaningless."

#~ msgid "只需要静态磁矩初始化，不需要多磁序分支（用 `Set Magnetic Moments`）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Only one moment initialization is needed, without magnetic-order branches "
#~ "→ use `Set Magnetic Moments`."

#~ msgid "磁矩格式和幅值"
#~ msgstr "Moment representation and magnitude"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "先把\"磁矩写多大、什么格式\"定下来，后面 FM/AFM/PM 分支都在这个基础上操"
#~ "作。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "First define moment magnitudes and representation. All FM, AFM, and PM-"
#~ "like branches are built from this common reference."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `Collinear (scalar)`。`Collinear` = 每个原子只有一个标量 ± 磁"
#~ "矩，沿 `Axis` 方向；`Non-collinear` = 每个原子一个 3D 矢量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: `Collinear (scalar)`. `Collinear` stores one signed "
#~ "scalar per atom along `Axis`; `Non-collinear` stores a three-component "
#~ "vector per atom."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "大多数共线磁序用标量就够了，简单且训练数据量小。如果你后续要做非共线螺旋、"
#~ "canting 或 DMI 相关训练，这里必须先切成矢量模式。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Scalar moments are sufficient for collinear orders and keep the data "
#~ "representation simple. Select vectors before downstream noncollinear "
#~ "spirals, canting, or DMI-related workflows."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`[x, y, z]`，默认 `[0, 0, 1]`（z 轴）。共线模式下磁矩沿这个方向；非共线模"
#~ "式下 FM/AFM 的默认方向也以它为参考。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`[x, y, z]`, default: `[0, 0, 1]`. Reference direction for collinear "
#~ "moments and for the default FM/AFM direction in noncollinear mode."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "改它之前先确认结构的晶胞取向——如果你的 slab 法向是 z，通常保持默认；如果研"
#~ "究面内各向异性，可能要改到 x 或 y。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Confirm the cell orientation before changing it. For a slab normal to "
#~ "*z*, the default may be appropriate; an in-plane anisotropy study may "
#~ "require *x* or *y*."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认空。`Fe:2.2, Ni:0.6` 这种格式，显式指定每个元素的磁矩大小。这是"
#~ "你最精确的控制方式——用已知的 DFT 或文献值填。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: empty. Explicit element magnitudes such as `Fe:2.2, "
#~ "Ni:0.6`. Use defensible values from DFT, experiment, or literature."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 false。打开后不同元素可以有不同的磁矩方向（从 `magmom_map` 中"
#~ "读取方向信息），而不是全沿 `Axis`。非共线多元素体系（比如 Fe↑ Mn↓）才会用"
#~ "到。标量模式下不需要开。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `false`. Preserve element-specific vector directions "
#~ "from `magmom_map` instead of aligning every moment with `Axis`. This is "
#~ "relevant to multielement noncollinear systems and has no effect in scalar "
#~ "mode."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.0。没在 `magmom_map` 里列出的元素统一用这个值。设 0 意味着"
#~ "非磁性元素不写磁矩。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.0`. Magnitude assigned to elements absent from "
#~ "`magmom_map`. Zero leaves unconfigured species without a moment."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认空（全部生效）。逗号分隔如 `Fe, Co`。只给这些元素写磁矩，其他的"
#~ "写 0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: empty, meaning all elements. A comma-separated list such "
#~ "as `Fe, Co` restricts moments to those species; all others receive zero."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "优先级：`magmom_map` 命中的 → 用映射值；没命中但被 `apply_elements` 包含"
#~ "的 → 用 `default_moment`；都不在的 → 写 0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Precedence: an element found in `magmom_map` uses the mapped value; an "
#~ "unmatched element included by `apply_elements` uses `default_moment`; all "
#~ "others receive zero."

#~ msgid "FM / AFM 分支"
#~ msgstr "FM and AFM branches"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "这两张复选框决定输出里有没有铁磁和反铁磁构型。通常至少保留 FM ——它是一个重"
#~ "要的能量参考态。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "These options control whether FM and AFM initializations are produced. "
#~ "Retain FM when it is a relevant reference state for the material."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 true。打开 → 输出一个铁磁结构（所有磁矩同向）。关掉它意味着你"
#~ "只要 AFM/PM，比较少见。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `true`. Produce one FM structure with all target moments "
#~ "parallel."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 true。打开 → 输出反铁磁结构。需要选一种 AFM 构造方式："
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `true`. Produce an AFM structure using one of the "
#~ "following construction methods."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `k-vector`。`k-vector` 用波矢自动翻转——简单、不需要上游准备。"
#~ "`group A/B` 用手动标注的 group 标签决定正负——更灵活，但需要先用 `Group "
#~ "Label` 卡打好标签。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: `k-vector`. `k-vector` assigns alternating signs from a "
#~ "phase pattern without upstream labels. `group A/B` assigns signs from "
#~ "explicit `group` labels and requires a preceding `Group Label` card."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你很可能先从 k-vector 试起。只有当你发现 k-vector 的翻转面切到了不等价原子"
#~ "（比如 NiO 里 Ni 和 O 两种子晶格被混在一起了），再切到 group A/B。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Start with k-vector for a simple periodic pattern. Switch to group A/B "
#~ "when the desired magnetic sublattices cannot be represented by a "
#~ "geometric phase alone, such as when inequivalent species must be treated "
#~ "separately."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `111`。仅 k-vector 模式。`100` / `010` / `001` / `110` / "
#~ "`111`。沿这个方向相邻原子层磁矩正负交替。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: `111`. Used only in k-vector mode. Choices are `100`, "
#~ "`010`, `001`, `110`, and `111`; the sign alternates according to the "
#~ "corresponding layer phase."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `A`。仅 group A/B 模式。`atoms.arrays['group']` 中等于这个标签"
#~ "的原子取正号磁矩。它必须和上游 `Group Label` 卡写入的标签完全一致，包括大"
#~ "小写。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: `A`. Used only in group A/B mode. Atoms whose "
#~ "`atoms.arrays['group']` equals this case-sensitive label receive positive "
#~ "moments."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `B`。仅 group A/B 模式。`atoms.arrays['group']` 中等于这个标签"
#~ "的原子取负号磁矩。通常和 `afm_group_a` 成对使用，用来显式指定两套反平行子"
#~ "晶格。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: `B`. Used only in group A/B mode. Atoms with this case-"
#~ "sensitive group label receive negative moments, defining the sublattice "
#~ "antiparallel to `afm_group_a`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 true。仅 group A/B 模式。打开 → 不属于 A 也不属于 B 的原子磁"
#~ "矩置零。关掉 → 这些原子默认为正。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `true`. In group A/B mode, set moments outside groups A "
#~ "and B to zero. When disabled, unmatched target atoms default to the "
#~ "positive sign."

#~ msgid "PM 分支"
#~ msgstr "PM-like branch"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "PM 生成大量随机磁序样本。默认关闭的——因为开了输出数量会乘上 `pm_count + "
#~ "2`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The PM-like branch creates random moment directions and is disabled by "
#~ "default because it can increase the output count by `pm_count` in "
#~ "addition to the FM and AFM branches."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后才生成顺磁构型。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `false`. Enable to generate paramagnetic-like initial "
#~ "states."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 10。生成几个 PM 样本。5-10 覆盖基本无序态，20+ 做统计训练。注"
#~ "意每帧输出 = 1 FM（如果开了）+ 1 AFM（如果开了）+ `pm_count` 个 PM。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `10`. Number of PM-like samples. Use 5–10 for basic "
#~ "disorder coverage and 20 or more for statistical sampling. Per-frame "
#~ "output equals the enabled FM branch plus the enabled AFM branch plus "
#~ "`pm_count`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `sphere`。`sphere` — 磁矩方向在球面上均匀撒。`cone` — 限制在"
#~ "以 `Axis` 为中心的锥面内，锥角由下面的 `PM Cone Angle` 控制。如果你要模拟"
#~ "有限温度下自旋偏离平衡方向不太远的情况，用 cone；要模拟完全无序的顺磁态，"
#~ "用 sphere。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: `sphere`. `sphere` samples directions uniformly over the "
